              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Download an ONNX wind-prediction model from HuggingFace for the Wind Predictor component.
Yel 2.0 is public; Esen 1.0 and Poyraz 1.0 need a HuggingFace token.
All are 8-channel Wind Predictor models. (Yel 1.0 is a different architecture — the GAN image model used by GAN Predict via its API — and cannot be loaded here.)
Models cache in ~/SUS_LAB/ and are reused on subsequent runs.

