                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Resolution of the internal MRT sky hemisphere, as a SUBDIVISION LEVEL: the dome has 6 x 4^level faces, half of them above the horizon. Higher levels smooth the view factors but cost time on every probe; 5 (3072 patches) is ample for MRT.</item>
