              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Compute annual probe-specific UTCI from simulation outputs: MRT and wind-speed data trees, plus air temperature and relative humidity. For a weather-only calculator, use "UTCI (Weather)".

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.8.0.827

